        <gr str="2451">wisdom </gr>and <gr str="4148">instruction</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="8"> My <gr str="1121">son</gr>, <gr str="8085">hear </gr>the <gr str="4148">instruction </gr>of thy <gr str="1">father</gr>, and <gr str="5203">forsake </gr>
