      <VERS vnumber="31"> Therefore shall they <gr str="398">eat </gr>of the <gr str="4480 6529">fruit </gr>of their own <gr str="1870">way</gr>, and be <gr str="7646">filled </gr>with their own <gr str="4480 4156">devices</gr>. </VERS>
      <VERS vnumber="32">
        <gr str="3588">For </gr>the turning <gr str="4878">away </gr>of the <gr str="6612">simple </gr>shall <gr str="2026">slay </gr>them, and the <gr str="7962">prosperity </gr>of <gr str="3684">fools </gr>shall <gr str="6">destroy </gr>them. </VERS>
